        "page": null,
        "part": "body"
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Probation & Contract Changes",
        "Probation reviews"
      ],
      "text": "HR must keep the contract assignment and the signed terms aligned. A new contract normally includes a three-calendar-month probation period. HR sets the start date, review date, manager, and contract type before activation. Probation does not reduce the leave or sick-pay entitlement stated in the assigned contract. Managers should schedule a midpoint discussion after six weeks and a final review at least 10 calendar days before the probation end date.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": 2,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 5,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": "body"
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Probation & Contract Changes",
        "Record the outcome"
      ],
      "text": "Record the outcome",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": 0,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 6,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": "body"
      },
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Probation & Contract Changes",
        "Record the outcome"
      ],
      "text": "Open HR administration > Contracts and select the active assignment.",
      "type": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": 0,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 7,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": "body"
      },
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Probation & Contract Changes",
        "Record the outcome"
      ],
      "text": "Record the review outcome and attach the reviewed decision document.",
      "type": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": 0,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 8,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": "body"
      },
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Probation & Contract Changes",
        "Record the outcome"
      ],
      "text": "Obtain HR approval before changing probation dates or contract terms.",
      "type": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": 0,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 9,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": "body"
      },
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Probation & Contract Changes",
        "Record the outcome"
      ],
      "text": "Notify the employee through My documents and retain the acknowledgement or signature receipt.",
      "type": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 10,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": "body"
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Probation & Contract Changes",
        "Record the outcome"
      ],
      "text": "An extension is limited to one additional calendar month under this policy and requires a recorded reason before the original end date. If no decision is recorded, the system raises a review alert; it does not automatically dismiss the employee or create a signed extension. HR must resolve the record explicitly.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": 2,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 11,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": "body"
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Probation & Contract Changes",
        "Amendments and effective dates"
      ],
      "text": "Amendments and effective dates",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 12,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": "body"
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Probation & Contract Changes",
        "Amendments and effective dates"
      ],
      "text": "Changes to weekly hours, salary, contract type, or entitlement require a new effective-dated amendment. Never overwrite the old signed terms. The new assignment takes effect at 00:00 in the workplace timezone on the approved date. Salary changes starting midmonth use calendar-day proration: old monthly salary multiplied by old-term calendar days divided by month length, plus the equivalent new-term amount. Round only the final monthly base-pay line to two decimals.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": 2,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 13,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": "body"
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Probation & Contract Changes",
        "Downstream controls"
      ],
      "text": "Downstream controls",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 14,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": "body"
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Probation & Contract Changes",
        "Downstream controls"
      ],
      "text": "HR previews leave accrual, weekly overtime thresholds, and future roster compatibility before activating an amendment. Contract B entitlements are already part-time amounts and must not be prorated a second time. If the amendment is approved after the payroll cutoff on the 20th at 17:00 UTC, Payroll Operations records a separately identified adjustment in the next run. A rejected signature package leaves the existing contract active. Employee Documents & E-Signatures governs reissuing a corrected package and preserving the previous audit evidence.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": 2,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 15,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": "body"
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Probation & Contract Changes",
        "Approval record"
      ],
      "text": "Approval record",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 16,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": "body"
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Probation & Contract Changes",
        "Approval record"
      ],
      "text": "Before completing a change, check the effective dates, the approver's authority and the applicable contract version. Store the decision and reason in the restricted employee record. HR Operations reviews a sample of completed changes each month against the approval trail. Incorrect rule assignments are corrected prospectively; any retrospective adjustment is documented separately.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 17,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": "body"
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Probation & Contract Changes",
        "Approval record"
      ],
      "text": "Policy changes require an authorized approver, an effective date and a published replacement. HR Operations reviews the policy annually. Administrative disputes should be raised within 10 calendar days of notification; HR targets a written response within five business days and retains the original evidence during review.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ],
